d Hulu content in the Hulu hub within the Disney+ app.*\n- A curated selection of live sports events, ESPN Originals, and studio programming in the ESPN hub within the Disney+ app*\n\n\nFor help with Disney+: http://help.disneyplus.com\n\n\n**For our Subscriber Agreement and other policies**: https://disneyplus.com/legal/subscriber-agreement\n\n\n**Your US State Privacy Rights**:  privacy.twdc.com/state\n\n\n**Do Not Sell or Share My Information**: https://privacy.thewaltdisneycompany.com/en/dnssmpi/\n\n\n*U.S. residents, 18+ only. A limited selection of content from Hulu and ESPN are now available to all Disney+ subscribers. To access the full ESPN on Disney+ and Hulu on Disney+ experience, you must bundle those services with your Disney+ subscription. \n\n\nDisney+ Subscription required. You must be 10+ to use Meta Quest and have the latest version of Horizon OS installed.", "short_description": "Disney+ is the streaming home of your favorite stories.\n\nDisney+ subscription required. You must be 10+ to use Meta Quest and have the latest version of Horizon OS installed.\n\nFor help with Disney+: http://help.disneyplus.com\nFor our Subscriber Agreement and other policies: https://disneyplus.com/legal/subscriber-agreement\nYour US State Privacy Rights:  privacy.twdc.com/state\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information: https://privacy.thewaltdisneycompany.com/en/dnssmpi/"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.thewaltdisneycompany.com/en/current-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://disneyplus.com/legal/subscriber-agreement", "publisher_name": "Disney Electronic Content Inc", "support_website_url": "http://help.disneyplus.com/", "website_url": "https://www.disneyplus.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRE